%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-csv (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  [
    {
      name: "Mariano",
      lastname: "de Achaval",
      age: "37",
      gender: "male"
    },
    {
      name: "Paula",
      lastname: "de Estrada",
      age: "37",
      gender: "female"
    }
  ]
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/csv
name,lastname,age,gender
Mariano,de Achaval,37,male
Paula,de Estrada,37,female
%%% output application/dw
[
  {
    name: "Mariano",
    lastname: "de Achaval",
    age: "37",
    gender: "male"
  }, 
  {
    name: "Paula",
    lastname: "de Estrada",
    age: "37",
    gender: "female"
  }
] as Array {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/csv"}
